Title = {Comprehensive Compliance Framework for RISC-V Architectures using the
   RISCOF Test Platform},
Booktitle = {2025 IEEE INTERNATIONAL SYMPOSIUM ON CIRCUITS AND SYSTEMS, ISCAS},
Series = {IEEE International Symposium on Circuits and Systems},
Year = {2025},
Note = {2025 International Symposium on Circuits and Systems-ISCAS-Annual,
   ENGLAND, MAY 25-28, 2025},
Abstract = {This paper presents a comprehensive compliance framework for RISC-V
   architectures and the benefit of the RISCOF test platform. The framework
   aims to ensure that RISC-V implementations, whether hardware or
   software, adhere to established specifications, and this framework has
   the flexibility and scalability for future extensions and updates in the
   RISC-V ecosystem. By utilizing a structured approach, the framework
   integrates various testing components to evaluate compliance
   effectively. Key features include the generation of targeted tests based
   on specific architecture profiles and the ability to assess both
   functional and performance aspects of implementations. The framework is
   designed to be flexible and scalable, accommodating future extensions
   and updates in the RISC-V ecosystem. Through rigorous testing and
   validation processes, it provides developers with essential tools to
   verify their designs against compliance standards. This work contributes
   to the growing body of knowledge in RISC-V architecture by offering a
   systematic method for ensuring compatibility and reliability across
   different implementations. Ultimately, this framework serves as a vital
   resource for engineers seeking to enhance the quality and integrity of
   RISC-V products in the market.},
