Affiliation = {Guerrero-Balaguera, JD (Corresponding Author), Politecn Torino DAUIN, Dept Control \& Comp Engn, Turin, Italy.
   Guerrero-Balaguera, Juan-David; Limas-Sierra, Robert; Sensoz, Oguz; Condia, Josie E. Rodriguez; Reorda, Matteo Sonza, Politecn Torino DAUIN, Dept Control \& Comp Engn, Turin, Italy.
